irst.</p></div></div></section><section id=\"about\" class=\"bg-[#16120f] py-16\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-7xl items-center gap-10 px-4 md:grid-cols-2 md:px-8\"><div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-white/10\"><img src=\"/images/hero-food.jpg\" alt=\"Restaurant storefront\" class=\"h-[280px] w-full object-cover sm:h-[380px]\"/></div><div><p class=\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-orange-500\">Our Story</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-4xl font-black\">Good food starts with passion.</h3><p class=\"mt-5 leading-7 text-white/50\">We believe great food should be delicious, fresh and affordable. Our goal is simple — serve food that makes every customer want to come back for more.</p><p class=\"mt-4 leading-7 text-white/50\">From quick snacks to filling meals, every order is prepared with attention to taste and quality.</p><div class=\"mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><span class=\"rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-4 py-2 text-sm\">✓ Fresh Ingredients</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-4 py-2 text-sm\">✓ Quality Food</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-4 py-2 text-sm\">✓ Local Favourite</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-16 md:px-8\"><div class=\"mb-10 text-center\"><p class=\"text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-orange-500\">Customer love</p><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-4xl font-black\">What Customers Say</h3></div><div class=\"grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-[#171411] p-6\"><div class=\"text-orange-500\">★★★★★</div><p class=\"mt-5 leading-7 text-white/60\">&quot;<!-- -->Amazing taste and really good quantity. One of my favourite places now!<!-- -->&quot;</p><div class=\"mt-6 flex items-center gap-3\"><div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-orange-500/10 font-bold text-orange-500\">R</div><div><p class=\"font-bold\">Rahul</p><p class=\"